{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55603","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此事从来已绝疑，安然乐道合希夷。\n依山偶得还源旨，拂石闲题出格诗。\n水待冻开成细溜，薪从霜後拾枯枝。\n因兹永断攀缘意，誓与青松作老期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}